","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"魯陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"hqs_i1n_n5h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0026","start":26,"end":31,"surface":"宋司馬桓魋","kind":"person","person_id":"rin_y2m_uyz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"齊田常","kind":"person","person_id":"m0b_b5e_153","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m053-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p054","text":"三十七年，楚惠王滅陳。熒惑守心。心，宋之分野也。景公憂之。司星子韋曰：「可移於相。」景公曰：「相，吾之股肱。」曰：「可移於民。」景公曰：「君者待民。」曰：「可移於歲。」景公曰：「歲饑民困，吾誰爲君！」子韋曰：「天髙聽卑。君有君人之言三，熒惑宜有動。」於是候之，果徙三度。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"楚惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"bff_e4b_8yv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m054-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"熒惑","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-s