8,"end":120,"surface":"熒惑","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p055","text":"六十四年，景公卒。宋公子特攻殺太子而自立，是爲昭公。昭公者，元公之曾庶孫也。昭公父公孫糾，糾父公子褍秦，褍秦即元公少子也。景公殺昭公父糾，故昭公怨殺太子而自立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"宋公子特","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"5da_d1r_s7j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"元公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"公孫糾","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"糾","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0047","start":47,"end":51,"surface":"公子褍秦","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"褍秦","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"元公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"糾","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"昭公","kind":"person","person_id":"rex_cs0_mfo_AAABAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m055-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"5da_d1r_s7j","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p050","text":"嗟箕子乎！嗟箕子乎！正言不用，乃反為奴。武庚既死，周封微子。襄公傷於泓，君子孰稱。景公謙德，熒惑退行。剔成暴虐，宋乃滅亡。喜微子問太師，作宋世家第八。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m050-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"8a9_tj8_6i7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m050-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"8a9_tj8_6i7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m050-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"武庚","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m050-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"微子","kind":"person","person_id":"buv_igi_gpn_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m050-0